step Stormwind flight master
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 66.3,62.7 "Stormwind flight master"
  getfp "Stormwind"

step Stormwind Keep
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Bolvar Fordragon stands in the throne room of Stormwind Keep, at the north end of the city. Then leave by the main gate for Westfall.
  turnin 94947                                -- Highlord Bolvar Fordragon
  accept 98021                                -- For Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill

step Baros Alexston
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Baros Alexston stands in Cathedral Square, on the way from the Keep to the main gate: his compass is in his old house in Westfall, on the way.
  accept 399

step Woo Ping
  only Warrior
  zone Stormwind City
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Two-Handed Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Two-Handed Swords from Woo Ping (Trade District, 10 silver); two-handers level a Warrior fastest.
  train 11867                         -- Woo Ping

step Woo Ping
  only Hunter
  zone Stormwind City
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Staves" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Staves from Woo Ping (Trade District, 10 silver); a Hunter's melee weapon is mostly its stats, and two-handers carry the most.
  train 11867                         -- Woo Ping

step Woo Ping
  only Rogue
  zone Stormwind City
  when money>=10s
  when !skill "Swords" 1
  tip While you're here: learn Swords from Woo Ping (Trade District, 10 silver); a sword in the main hand levels a Rogue steadily.
  train 11867                         -- Woo Ping

step Stormwind City
  only Druid
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 20.9,55.5 "Stormwind City"

step Sheldras Moontree
  only Druid
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Sheldras Moontree, Stormwind's druid trainer, teaches you Teleport: Moonglade. Dendrite Starblaze's welcome waits for your Cat Form trip at the end of Darkshore.
  turnin 94912                                -- Sheldras Moontree
  accept 94914

step Stormwind City
  only Mage
  zone Stormwind City
  goto 38.6,79.3 "Stormwind City"

step Jennea Cannon
  only Mage
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Jennea Cannon stands in the Wizard's Sanctum, the tower of the Mage Quarter; she gives you a flask for the Mirror Lake waterfall.
  accept 1861                                 -- Jennea Cannon

step Mirror Lake
  only Mage
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Leave Stormwind by the main gate. The Mirror Lake waterfall is south-west of the gates, on the way west to Westfall: fill Jennea's Flask at its base.
  collect 7206 quest 1861.1                   -- Mirror Lake Water Sample

step Westfall
  zone Westfall
  goto 59.9,19.4 "Westfall"
